OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has announced he will
OL,7,Fgive regional mayors a share of income
OL,8,Ftax in a move he calls the biggest
OL,9,Ftransfer of power from Westminster in
OL,10,Fa generation.
OL,12,FThe prime minister's plan allows
OL,13,FEnglish mayors to keep a share of the
OL,14,Fincome tax and business rates
OL,15,Fcollected in their area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FHe said: "Under our plans, more of the
OL,7,Ftaxes raised in a community will stay
OL,8,Fin that community. Soon, every local
OL,9,Fleader will have the power and
OL,10,Fresources to improve public transport,
OL,11,Fbuild homes and create jobs."
OL,13,FThe full details of the reforms are
OL,14,Fexpected to be announced in a white
OL,15,Fpaper, published after Chancellor John
OL,16,FHealey presents his first budget in
OL,17,Fthe autumn.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FBurnham, who was the Mayor of Greater
OL,7,FManchester for nearly a decade, said:
OL,8,F"I said we'd take power out of
OL,9,FWestminster and carry it into every
OL,10,Fpostcode in the country.
OL,12,F"Today, we make good on that promise."
OL,14,F"I know what it's like to be ignored
OL,15,Fby politicians in Westminster," he
OL,16,Fadded. "I'm not going to make that
OL,17,Fsame mistake now I'm PM."
OL,26,@pD@AOUtD@AOUvD@AOUxD@HOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
