OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe government has confirmed that the
OL,12,Frate of income tax for billpayers will
OL,13,Fnot change as a direct result of the
OL,14,Freforms, with Burnham determined to
OL,15,Fstick to his predecessor's manifesto
OL,16,Fcommitment of not raising taxes.
OL,18,FThe equalisation system will be
OL,19,Fretained, with areas where less tax is
OL,20,Fcollected continuing to receive
OL,21,Ffinancial support.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FFourteen areas in England have a
OL,7,Fregional mayor, including Greater
OL,8,FManchester, Liverpool City Region,
OL,9,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough, the
OL,10,FNorth East and West of England, with
OL,11,Fthis set to expand over the coming
OL,12,Fyears to include areas like Hampshire
OL,13,Fand the Solent and Greater Essex.
OL,15,FMayors have powers over issues such as
OL,16,Ftransport, skills and infrastructure
OL,17,Fplanning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
