CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FBurnham hosted several leaders across
OL,7,Fthe different parties last Friday on
OL,8,Fhis inaugural visit to No 10 North and
OL,9,Fsaid he was working to "make the UK
OL,10,Fone team".
OL,12,FChancellor John Healey said: "The
OL,13,Fpeople who best understand what skills
OL,14,Femployers want, what transport an area
OL,15,Fneeds and where investment can make
OL,16,Fthe biggest difference are those who
OL,17,Flive there.
OL,26,@tD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,F"For the first time we're giving
OL,7,Fmayors a share of income tax so
OL,8,Fcommunities directly benefit when
OL,9,Ftheir economy grows ` passing power
OL,10,Fout of Westminster and driving growth
OL,11,Fin every postcode.
OL,13,F"This is the way we start to build new
OL,14,Fhope and advance the working people of
OL,15,Fthis country."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,7,FGovernment Secretary Angela Rayner
OL,8,Fsaid the announcement would put "an
OL,9,Fend to the begging-bowl culture of the
OL,10,Fpast", instead giving locally elected
OL,11,Fleaders "the tools they need to drive
OL,12,Fthe change that communities have been
OL,13,Fcrying out for".
OL,15,FRayner worked alongside Starmer at the
OL,16,Fstart of his premiership to drive for
OL,17,Fmore regional mayors and devolution
OL,18,Fand frequently shared the message that
OL,19,Fthose "with skin in the game" are the
OL,20,Fbest placed to deliver for their local
OL,21,Farea.
OL,26,@pD@aOUrD@EO]sD@IOUuD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FSome mayors are thought to be
OL,7,Fconsidering using their powers to roll
OL,8,Fout tax reliefs, including
OL,9,FConservative Tees Valley mayor Lord
OL,10,FHouchen of High Leven and Reform UK's
OL,11,FGreater Lincolnshire mayor Dame Andrea
OL,12,FJenkyns, according to reports in The
OL,13,FTimes newspaper.
OL,15,FThe Conservatives signalled they
OL,16,Fdoubted the tax reforms would help
OL,17,Fregions across England to flourish.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FSir James Cleverly said Burnham was
OL,7,Fright to focus on growth but warned
OL,8,Fhis plans risked higher taxes and
OL,9,Fwould not necessarily improve outcomes.
OL,11,FThe shadow local government secretary
OL,12,Fargued devolution should be developed
OL,13,Fwith local communities rather than
OL,14,Fimposed from Westminster, adding that
OL,15,Fpolicies that work in Manchester may
OL,16,Fnot suit areas such as Essex, Cornwall
OL,17,For Cumbria.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
