FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FThe Lib Dems warned that devolving tax
OL,7,Frevenues to mayors would "leave behind
OL,8,Flarge swathes of England" that did not
OL,9,Fhave a mayoral authority.
OL,11,FReform UK home affairs spokesman Zia
OL,12,FYusuf said the prime minister should
OL,13,F"fully devolve the power to stop the
OL,14,Fhousing of illegal migrants in local
OL,15,Fcommunities by the Home Office".
OL,26,@oD@ZOUpD@YO]uD@AOUwD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,FHe said: "Andy Burnham says he wants
OL,7,Fto devolve power and actually listen
OL,8,Fto local people. If he was listening,
OL,9,Fhe would know that they do not want
OL,10,Funvetted illegal migrants dumped in
OL,11,Ftheir areas."
OL,13,FLib Dem local government spokeswoman
OL,14,FZoe Franklin said: "Councils across
OL,15,FEngland serve millions of people who
OL,16,Fdeserve the same powers and resources
OL,17,Fas any city region.
OL,26,@nD@JOUsD@MO]vD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785482286
OL,3,CRegional mayors to receive share of
OL,4,Cincome tax under Burnham plans
OL,6,F"Devolution cannot become a two-tier
OL,7,Fsystem where you only get real powers,
OL,8,Fand access to extra income tax
OL,9,Frevenues, if you have a metro mayor.
OL,11,F"We will analyse the detail carefully
OL,12,Fwhen it is published and continue to
OL,13,Ffight for every community across
OL,14,FEngland to benefit from devolution."
OL,16,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,17,Four political experts are across all
OL,18,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,19,Fto the latest episode below...
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@dO]
